{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to dive into the digital dust of BurnerSphere! Created by BRCvr in collaboration with Burning Man Project, this isn\u2019t your typical VR experience\u2014it's a fully immersive, interactive documentary that lets YOU explore Black Rock City and its vibrant communities from anywhere in the world! Team up with friends, discover iconic art installations, join interactive workshops, and connect with others in real-time. With stunning 360\u00b0 and 180\u00b0 videos, detailed virtual environments, and endless opportunities for spontaneous social interaction, BurnerSphere captures the spirit of Burning Man and inspires creativity and community year-round. Ready to burn bright? Let\u2019s go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up account at our website and link that account with 6 digit code.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3704930?t=1764812620","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704930/5b1165fa4e18c3298a549bf1eddfead892eaa389/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764812620","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704930/158339a931db9c7f2c902c1c24d73eeee954e700/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764812620","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704930/158339a931db9c7f2c902c1c24d73eeee954e700/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764812620","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Chat Speech-to-text","id":72},{"description":"Chat Text-to-speech","id":73},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"de